  schema:name "Blockbuster: Horrors and Hilarity";
  schema:description """
	<h1>On Wednesday and Thursday evenings in October</h1><span><br/></span>Become a studio executive as our improvisers bring hit new movies to life! Performers pitch movie premises and audiences take their pick! But in this special version of the show, all the pitches need to have a spooky angle! From the opening line to the final twist, watch as our performers create characters, scenes, and scares of entirely original movies FRIGHT before your eyes!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Run time: 90 minutes including intermission<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rating: 🌶️🌶️🌶️ – Best for teens and up.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please Note: as The Improv Centre is a licensed facility, all minors (persons under the age of 19) must be accompanied by an adult.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All physical vouchers must now be redeemed via phone or email. Please contact the box office for assistance.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-29T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/improvcentrevancouver/files/7427bf77-b09b-4fe1-9608-fde2e40e9ddb.jpeg>;
