  schema:name "Deadly Dinner Party";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"UnderlineText\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://theimprovcentre.ca/seasonpass/\">Become a Season Pass Holder &amp; Save on this show!</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h1>Friday & Saturday evenings until Oct 30th</h1><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Please note: if you're hungry for laughs, you're going to eat well! If you're looking for dinner, you're going to stay hungry – we don't serve food aside from snacks.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Looking for dinner before or after your show? Visit one of our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://theimprovcentre.ca/restaurant-partners/\">restaurant partners!</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A classic whodunnit of improvised proportions!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Five VIPs receive letters from an eccentric millionaire, summoning them to a mysterious dinner. When murder is served as the first course, a detective must interrogate each guest and solve the crime before it’s too late.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>When the host is murdered, suspicion falls on everyone at the table. Accusations fly, alibis unravel, and every new revelation sends the mystery in a completely unexpected direction. With every twist created on the spot, no two performances – and no two killers – are ever the same!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A hilarious take on beloved whodunnits like Agatha Christie novels, Clue, and Knives Out – Deadly Dinner Party is a perfect way to usher in the most ominous season of the year.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Run time: 90 minutes including intermission<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rated: 🌶️🌶️🌶️ – Best for teens and up.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please Note: as The Improv Centre is a licensed facility, all minors (persons under the age of 19) must be accompanied by an adult.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All physical vouchers must now be redeemed via phone or email. Please contact the box office for assistance.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-30T21:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/improvcentrevancouver/files/0f895ef9-b3ed-4959-a0f9-14bab9367bef.jpeg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/improvcentrevancouver/location/603AMBLCJQMLRJDMDQKBNHDKQPPDPCQLJ>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/improvcentrevancouver/organization/the-improv-centre>;
  schema:url <https://theimprovcentre.ca/shows/>;
  schema:offers _:9ec39dc5c604456196f82735f7e99ad46720;
  schema:duration "PT90M";
  schema:endDate "2026-10-30T22:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

