<http://www.spektrix.com/improvcentrevancouver/event/68402ANBGNRLBCHMDHKDRKDCPBPDHRDDH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Heart Felt Holiday: An Improvised Puppet Rom-Com";
  schema:description """
	<h2>A very human love story. With puppets.</h2><span><br/></span>In this joyful, completely improvised holiday rom-com, we follow a puppet looking for love while juggling work, family drama, friendships, and the general messiness of the season.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Set in a bustling holiday town where humans and puppets share the same world, Heart Felt Holiday explores the very human experience of falling in love, finding your people, and figuring out where you belong.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Improvisers handle double duties, performing as human characters, and also become puppeteers at any point in the show! You'll see our performers take on puppet characters and roles that usually wouldn't ever be possible.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With improvisers and puppets sharing the stage, you can expect holiday romances, genuine feelings, ridiculous puppet problems, and a love story that’ll turn out differently each and every night. Make this show part of your season’s festivities, and you just might have your most Heart Felt Holiday yet!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Run time: 90 minutes including intermission.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rated: 🌶️ – Suitable for all ages.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please Note: as The Improv Centre is a licensed facility, all minors (persons under the age of 19) must be accompanied by an adult.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All physical vouchers must now be redeemed via phone or email. Please contact the box office for assistance.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
