	<h1>Select Tuesday evenings!</h1><span><br/></span>There’s nothing wrong with oversharing in public, right? Especially if it fuels incredible comedy! In this show, audience members share true stories – from your office win of the week to the household thorn in your side – and our cast turns them into fast, hilarious improvised scenes.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In the second half, the performers share their own true stories in a classic Armando-style format, sparking even more laughs. Expect heartfelt storytelling, genuine connection, and a reminder that real life can be pretty funny!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets are Sliding Scale: $15-$20-$25<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Run time: 90 minutes including intermission.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rated: 🌶️🌶️ – Best for audiences ages 8 and up.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please Note: as The Improv Centre is a licensed facility, all minors (persons under the age of 19) must be accompanied by an adult.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All physical vouchers must now be redeemed via phone or email. Please contact the box office for assistance.
""";
